      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• node init-task.ts JIRA-X\n• 自动生成 docs/wip/JIRA-X/\n  - .state.yaml (状态追踪)\n  - spec.md (需求契约)\n  - tasks.md (TDD 任务清单)\n  - test-plan.md & changelog.md",
