      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• node init-task.ts JIRA-X\n• 自动生成 docs/wip/JIRA-X/\n  - .state.yaml (状态追踪)\n  - spec.md (需求契约)\n  - tasks.md (TDD 任务清单)\n  - test-plan.md & changelog.md",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
