      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 查阅 bug-ledger / gotchas 防御\n• RED: 编写挂掉的单测\n• GREEN: 最小化实现业务逻辑\n• REFACTOR: 结构优化/保持全绿\n• 运行 check.ts 静态规则自检",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 查阅 bug-ledger / gotchas 防御\n• RED: 编写挂掉的单测\n• GREEN: 最小化实现业务逻辑\n• REFACTOR: 结构优化/保持全绿\n• 运行 check.ts 静态规则自检",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
